 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? That's very common. Would you rather start on quiet back roads and work your way up, or start in a quiet town and explore from there? Most people start on quiet back roads, then gradually move on busier roads, and only after that on motorways. The key is to start slow and build up. Also, ride with a friend in the car and keep your first few rides short. Roughly how far from home do you feel comfortable going right now?",
